1	/**
2	 * Central, authoritative model selection broker.
3	 * 
4	 * This is the ONLY place where routing decisions are made.
5	 * All consumers (Frontend, Backend, UI) follow this decision.
6	 * 
7	 * Once decided: slot_id, model_id, fallback_policy are FIXED.
8	 * No re-evaluation, no implicit re-routing.
9	 */
